  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.0: Added MPEG-TS (Transport Stream) format support with automatic PAT/PMT parsing for teletext PID detection and manual PID specification via --pid CLI option. Includes DVB teletext extraction with proper LSB-first bit reversal. All parsers now support TS format with full magazine/row filtering capabilities.",
